      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Even just being able to filter user searches by trust level would go a long way --- for instance, if you met someone who was a Trusted User, that number of total users is very small compared to the number of Visitors in VRChat, so a user search would be greatly reduced and much easier to locate the person you wanted to add as a friend.",
