  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-05-15T10:50:33.036Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So I'm more or less socially retarded, and I feel that I'm not alone in this. I can't count how many times I've really enjoyed interacting with someone new to me in VRChat and thought, \"hey, I should really friend this person,\" but yet I didn't do it right away, still feeling a bit socially anxious and wanting to warm up a bit more before reaching out...\nTLDR; by the time I was finally done processing my recent social experiences with these new people and ready to add as friends, they were typically already gone from that world. This has happened to me so many times! If I could lookup \"recently met players,\" I'd be able to reconnect, but my memory isn't that good and many of these players were international, so I don't know how to pronounce or write their names anyway. I've had zero success looking them up.\nWith a \"players met\" feature, all of these budding potential friendships could grow into something real for people like me who struggle to connect. It's really difficult to build quality relationships when you just hop from world to world — but if we could reach out to the people who affected us and touched our hearts, it would make a world of difference!",
